                     <summary>Prayer of the Covenant, ኪዳን፡ ዘነግህ, fol. 4r-9v; Ṭabiba ṭabibān, Wise of the wise, fol. 9v-24r; Image of Jesus, fol. 24r-32r; Image of the cross, fol. 32r-37r; Image of the passion, fol. 37r-44r; Mystagogia, fol. 44r-48r; Sword of divinity, ሰይፈ፡ መለኮት, fol. 48r-50v; Eucharistic hymn, Congregation of the faithful men and women, fol. 50v-53v; Prayer called 'God of Luminaries', fol. 53v-55v; Prayer, Behold I have taken refuge in the letters of your name, fol. 55v-61v; Image of Mary, fol. 62r-70r; Saqoqāwa dengel, Lamentation of the Virgin, fol. 70r-78v; Image of the Pact of Mercy, fol. 78v-85r; ʼAkko-nu beʼsi, አኮኑ፡ ብእሲ, Was he not a man?, fol. 85r-89v; Image of the Assumption, fol. 89v-92r; Hymn to Mary, O tenderhearted, fol. 92r-96r; Hymn, Rejoice, Mary, fol. 96r-99r; Hymn to Mary, In heaven and on earth, fol. 99r-105r; Prayer to Mary, መልክአ፡ ኤዶም, Malkeʼa Ēdom, fol. 105r-106v; Image of the guardian angel, fol. 106v-112v; Image of Michael, fol. 113r-119r; Greeting to Michael, fol. 119rv; Image of Gabriel, fol. 119v-125r; Greeting to Gabriel, fol. 125rv; Image of Raphael, fol. 125v-131v; Greeting to Raphael, fol. 131v-132r; Image of the four living creatures, fol. 132r-138r; Image of George, fol. 138v-145r; Greeting to George, fol. 145r-146r; Image of Basilides, fol. 146r-153v; Greeting to Basilides, fol. 153v-154r; Image of Claudius, fol. 154r-161v; Greeting to Claudius, fol. 161v-162r; Image of Stephen, fol. 162r-166r; Qenē poem on Stephen, fol. 166r; Greeting to Stephen, fol. 166rv; Image of Cyriacus, fol. 166v-173r; Greeting to Cyriacus, fol. 173rv; Image of John the Baptist, fol. 173v-177v; Greeting to John the Baptist, fol. 177v-178v; Image of Peter and Paul, fol. 178v-184r; Greeting to the Apostles, fol. 184r-185r; Image of Takla Hāymānot, fol. 185r-193r; Greeting to Takla Hāymānot, fol. 193r-194r; Image of Cyrus, fol. 194r-196v; Image of Samuel, fol. 196v-200r; Greeting to Samuel, fol. 200rv; Image of Anthony, fol. 200v-202v; Image of Julitta, fol. 202v-206v; Image of Ewosṭātēwos, fol. 207r-216v; Greeting to Ewosṭātēwos, incomplete at the end, fol. 216v                        
